{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simulates The\u00a0Look\u00a0&amp;\u00a0Feel Of\u00a0Old\u00a0Disk\u00a0Operating\u00a0Systems\u00a0(DOS).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contains\u00a0Many\u00a0Easter\u00a0Eggs,\u00a0Advancements\u00a0And\u00a0An\u00a0Idle-Game\u00a0Points\u00a0System\u00a0(With\u00a0A\u00a0TSR\u00a0Program\u00a0That\u00a0Runs\u00a0When Started With The &quot;Idle&quot; Command).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes\u00a0A\u00a0Full\u00a0Custom\u00a0File-System\u00a0Format (&quot;MabelFS&quot;)\u00a0That\u00a0Reads\u00a0From\u00a0A\u00a0Virtual\u00a0Hard\u00a0Disk\u00a0Image &quot;vDisk&quot;. <br>All Save Data\u00a0Also Lives\u00a0On\u00a0The\u00a0Virtual\u00a0Disk,\u00a0So\u00a0Deleting\u00a0It Resets The Game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You Can Also Enable &quot;Hacker Mode&quot; With A Special Command, That Turns The Text Green, And Plays A Music Track.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 12 Advancements\u00a0To Unlock, <br>3 Unique\u00a0Game\u00a0Modes\u00a0(Idle\u00a0Point System, MabelEdit Text Editor And MabelDOS Desktop Environment), <br>There's Plenty Of\u00a0Keyboard-Jabbing\u00a0To Enjoy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOTE:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The &quot;Hacker Mode&quot; Music Track Is A Placeholder I Made, To Avoid Copyright Issues.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Hackerman","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3740120/3e35aaca7b0dc3ee904365b1080dba06280ca118.jpg"},{"name":"Hot Footed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3740120/a5f164ea16d545b3a47d87103d9ef9b4d8a607ad.jpg"},{"name":"Definition Of Insanity","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3740120/bb22ddae4ba65b263c5a3df74cf36eaa36bfb969.jpg"},{"name":"The Cake Is A Lie","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3740120/83ca1bdb6f9d6f12eb062a1dbfa820f21ddcbb3c