0&amp;\u00a0Feel Of\u00a0Old\u00a0Disk\u00a0Operating\u00a0Systems\u00a0(DOS).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contains\u00a0Many\u00a0Easter\u00a0Eggs,\u00a0Advancements\u00a0And\u00a0An\u00a0Idle-Game\u00a0Points\u00a0System\u00a0(With\u00a0A\u00a0TSR\u00a0Program\u00a0That\u00a0Runs\u00a0When Started With The &quot;Idle&quot; Command).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes\u00a0A\u00a0Full\u00a0Custom\u00a0File-System\u00a0Format (&quot;MabelFS&quot;)\u00a0That\u00a0Reads\u00a0From\u00a0A\u00a0Virtual\u00a0Hard\u00a0Disk\u00a0Image &quot;vDisk&quot;. <br>All Save Data\u00a0Also Lives\u00a0On\u00a0The\u00a0Virtual\u00a0Disk,\u00a0So\u00a0Deleting\u00a0It Resets The Game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You Can Also Enable &quot;Hacker Mode&quot; With A Special Command, That Turns The Text Green, And Plays A Music Track.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 12 Advancements\u00a0To Unlock, <br>3 Unique\u00a0Game\u00a0Modes\u00a0(Idle\u00a0Point System, MabelEdit Text Editor And MabelDOS Desktop Environment), <br>There's Plenty Of\u00a0Keyboard-Jabbing\u00a0To Enjoy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOTE:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The &quot;Hacker Mode&quot; Music Track Is A Placeholder I Made, To Avoid Copyright Issues.</p>","developers":["MabelisYT"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740120/7b5b17cba7193612773c9cd47291acaf64875a82/header.jpg?t=1772460904","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> LTS Kernel &gt;= v6.12<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-7600K / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 128 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Kernel &gt;= 6.19<br></l